{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09198","headline":"荅刘西曹 · 韦应物","name":"荅刘西曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公馆夜云寂，微凉羣树秋。\n西曹得时彦，华月共淹留。\n长啸举清觞，志气谁与俦。\n千龄事虽邈，俯念忽已周。\n篇翰如云兴，京洛颇优游。\n诠文不独古，理妙即同流。\n浅劣见推许，恐爲识者尤。\n空慙文璧赠，日夕不能酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}